# AgentGov policies - Day 1 fix, real OCI IAM policy syntax
# Allow group <group> to <verb> <resource> in compartment <compartment>
Allow group infra-drafters to manage drafts in compartment Drafts
Allow group security-auditors to read drafts in compartment Drafts
Allow group security-auditors to manage audit-results in compartment Audit-Results
Allow group infra-deployers-nonprod to read drafts in compartment Drafts
Allow group infra-deployers-nonprod to manage deployments in compartment Non-Production
Allow group prod-deployers to manage deployments in compartment Production
